  "The single source of truth for module order. dev.html and the distributable",
  "HTML are both generated from this list, so they can never drift apart.",
  "",
  "Order matters: each file becomes its own <script> in both builds, and a",
  "module may only reference another module's top-level const/let at RUN time,",
  "not while it is being parsed. If you add a file, put it next to its",
  "neighbours here and re-run ./build.sh."
